            {
              "content": "=You are an AI operations analyst for a retail SMB business.\n\nAnalyze the inventory item and return ONLY valid JSON.\n\nRequired JSON structure:\n\n{\n\"risk_level\": \"Low | Medium | High | Critical\",\n\"urgency_score\": 1-10,\n\"operational_priority\": \"Low | Moderate | High | Immediate\",\n\"business_impact\": \"short operational/business impact\",\n\"recommendation\": \"specific reorder recommendation\",\n\"estimated_stockout_days\": number\n}\n\nInventory Data:\nItem Name: {{$json.item_name}}\nCategory: {{$json.Category}}\nSupplier: {{$json.Supplier}}\nCurrent Stock: {{$json.current_stock}}\nReorder Threshold: {{$json.threshold}}\nUnit Price: {{$json.unit_price}}\n\nAnalysis Rules:\n\n* Consider stock severity\n* Consider operational disruption risk\n* Consider urgency of reorder action\n* Keep business impact concise\n* Recommendation must be actionable\n* Return ONLY valid JSON\n* No markdown\n* No ```json blocks\n* No explanations"
            }
          ]
        },
